      "note": "TASCAM Model 12 spec page (opened): 8 XLR mic inputs with phantom, 8 Hi-Z instrument inputs, 10 line inputs in total, 3.5 mm TRRS smartphone input, USB-C (12 in / 10 out), 5-pin MIDI in / out, dedicated click output, Bluetooth 5, SD recording; power from an AC adaptor (external). The page does not list the main, monitor and headphone outputs: XLR main L / R and 2 headphone outputs follow the plan summary from the knowledge base (an assumption), so beta-modelled. Modelled subset: 4 of 8 combos (XLR part), 4 line jacks, main L / R, 2 phones, USB-C. Size 343 x 360 x 98.8 mm including side panels and knobs (page), 4.3 kg. Slab profile is an estimate: the sources give only the outer sizes (rear height at the io edge, a lower front lip); the real desk is not a straight wedge. Positions guesses."
